    "embedding_text": "Sharepoint (T1213.002) is a MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise technique in the Collection tactic. Adversaries may leverage the SharePoint repository as a source to mine valuable information. SharePoint will often contain useful information for an adversary to learn about the structure and functionality of the internal network and systems. For example, the following is a list of example information that may hold potential value to an adversary and may also be found on SharePoint:\n\n* Policies, procedures, and standards\n* Physical / logical network diagrams\n* System architecture diagrams\n* Tech It affects Office Suite, Windows platforms and has been observed used by APT28, Akira, Chimera, HAFNIUM, Ke3chang, LAPSUS$, VOID MANTICORE . Recommended mitigations include Audit, User Account Management, User Training. Detection relies on Application Log Content, Cloud Service Metadata, Logon Session Creation.",
    "semantic_summary": "Adversaries may leverage the SharePoint repository as a source to mine valuable information.",
