    "Security Recommendations": "Network Segmentation, Restrict File and Directory Permissions",
    "Attacker Perspective": "An attacker leverages Runtime Data Manipulation to advance the 'Impact' objective, typically requiring access to a Linux, macOS, Windows system.",
