    "Detection Opportunities": "Detectable via Behavioral Detection of Native API Invocation via Unusual DLL Loads and Direct Syscalls",
    "Security Recommendations": "Execution Prevention, Behavior Prevention on Endpoint",
    "Attacker Perspective": "An attacker leverages Native API to advance the 'Execution' objective, typically requiring access to a Linux, macOS, Windows system.",
