    "embedding_text": "Direct Cloud VM Connections (T1021.008) is a MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise technique in the Lateral Movement tactic. Adversaries may leverage [Valid Accounts](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078) to log directly into accessible cloud hosted compute infrastructure through cloud native methods. Many cloud providers offer interactive connections to virtual infrastructure that can be accessed through the [Cloud API](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/009), such as Azure Serial Console(Citation: Azure Serial Console), AWS EC2 Instance Connect(Citation: EC2 Instance Connect)(Citation: lucr-3: Getting Sa It affects IaaS platforms and has been observed used by various threat actors . Recommended mitigations include User Account Management, Disable or Remove Feature or Program. Detection relies on Logon Session Creation, Process Creation.",
