    "Detection Opportunities": "Detectable via Detect Time-Based Evasion via Sleep, Timer Loops, and Delayed Execution",
    "Security Recommendations": "",
    "Attacker Perspective": "An attacker leverages Time Based Checks to advance the 'Stealth' objective, typically requiring access to a Linux, macOS, Windows system.",
