    "beginner_explanation": "Time Based Checks is a technique attackers use during the Stealth, Discovery stage of an intrusion. In simple terms: Adversaries may employ various time-based methods to detect virtualization and analysis environments, particularly those that attempt to manipulate time mechanisms to simulate longer elapses of time.",
