    "attacker_view": "An attacker leverages Network Device Configuration Dump to advance the 'Collection' objective, typically requiring access to a Network Devices system.",
    "defender_view": "Defenders should monitor Command Execution, Network Connection Creation, Network Traffic Content and apply mitigations such as Encrypt Sensitive Information, Network Segmentation, Network Intrusion Prevention to reduce exposure to Network Device Configuration Dump.",
    "detection_story": "This technique can be surfaced by correlating Detection Strategy for Network Device Configuration Dump via Config Repositories.",
