    "Attacker Perspective": "An attacker leverages Default Accounts to advance the 'Stealth' objective, typically requiring access to a Containers, ESXi, IaaS, Identity Provider, Linux, macOS, Network Devices, Office Suite, SaaS, Windows system.",
