    "Detection Opportunities": "Detectable via Detection of Adversarial Process Discovery Behavior",
    "Security Recommendations": "",
    "Attacker Perspective": "An attacker leverages Process Discovery to advance the 'Discovery' objective, typically requiring access to a ESXi, Linux, macOS, Network Devices, Windows system.",
    "technique_id": "T1057",
    "technique_name": "Process Discovery",
