    "embedding_text": "Gather Victim Org Information (T1591) is a MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise technique in the Reconnaissance tactic. Adversaries may gather information about the victim's organization that can be used during targeting. Information about an organization may include a variety of details, including the names of divisions/departments, specifics of business operations, as well as the roles and responsibilities of key employees.\n\nAdversaries may gather this information in various ways, such as direct elicitation via [Phishing for Information](https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1598). Information about an organizat It affects PRE platforms and has been observed used by APT28, FIN7, Kimsuky, Lazarus Group, MirrorFace, Moonstone Sleet, Volt Typhoon . Recommended mitigations include Pre-compromise. Detection relies on behavioral monitoring.",
    "semantic_summary": "Adversaries may gather information about the victim's organization that can be used during targeting.",
