    "embedding_text": "Search Open Websites/Domains (T1593) is a MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise technique in the Reconnaissance tactic. Adversaries may search freely available websites and/or domains for information about victims that can be used during targeting. Information about victims may be available in various online sites, such as social media, new sites, or those hosting information about business operations such as hiring or requested/rewarded contracts.(Citation: Cyware Social Media)(Citation: SecurityTrails Google Hacking)(Citation: ExploitDB GoogleHacking)\n\nAdversaries may search in different online sites depending  It affects PRE platforms and has been observed used by APT-C-36, Contagious Interview, Mustang Panda, Sandworm Team, Star Blizzard, Volt Typhoon . Recommended mitigations include Audit, Application Developer Guidance. Detection relies on behavioral monitoring.",
