    "beginner_explanation": "Valid Accounts is a technique attackers use during the Stealth, Persistence, Privilege Escalation, Initial Access stage of an intrusion. In simple terms: Adversaries may obtain and abuse credentials of existing accounts as a means of gaining Initial Access, Persistence, Privilege Escalation, or Defense Evasion.",
