    "embedding_text": "Obtain Capabilities (T1588) is a MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise technique in the Resource Development tactic. Adversaries may buy and/or steal capabilities that can be used during targeting. Rather than developing their own capabilities in-house, adversaries may purchase, freely download, or steal them. Activities may include the acquisition of malware, software (including licenses), exploits, certificates, and information relating to vulnerabilities. Adversaries may obtain capabilities to support their operations throughout numerous phases of the adversary lifecycle.\n\nIn addition to downloading free ma It affects PRE platforms and has been observed used by various threat actors . Recommended mitigations include Pre-compromise. Detection relies on Certificate Registration, Malware Content, Malware Metadata, Response Content.",
